@lang en
IMPORT `cstd-ch2-benefits`

-- Tests for Chapter 2 (Articles 12 to 19) and the hand-checked part of the annexes. Every
-- expected value was worked out by hand from the clause cited before it was run. Money in
-- dong. C1 (cstd-tests-fixtures.l4): issued and effective 1 January 2020, a woman born 1
-- July 1985, 34 Tuổi at the effective date; her comfort cash coupon falls at the anniversary
-- at which she reaches 75 Tuổi: 34 + 41 = 75, the 41st anniversary, 1 January 2061.

§ `Tests — Chapter 2`

§§ `Readings used below`

GIVEN h IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `A measurement`
`coma readings of` h MEANS
    LIST (`A measurement` OF `hours without response to external stimuli`, h),
         (`A measurement` OF `days after the coma at which the permanent neurological deficit is assessed`, 30)

`1 billion` MEANS 1000000000

§§ `Article 14 — one test per row of the table, and the row after it`

-- src:903 to 914: 20%, 40%, 60%, 80%; from 4 Tuổi the article does not apply.
#ASSERT `14 — the percentage of the sum insured at Tuổi` 0 EQUALS 0.2
#ASSERT `14 — the percentage of the sum insured at Tuổi` 1 EQUALS 0.4
#ASSERT `14 — the percentage of the sum insured at Tuổi` 2 EQUALS 0.6
#ASSERT `14 — the percentage of the sum insured at Tuổi` 3 EQUALS 0.8
#ASSERT `14 — the percentage of the sum insured at Tuổi` 4 EQUALS 1

-- C-toddler: born 1 May 2018, effective 1 January 2020. On 1 March 2022 the Tuổi is 3
-- (fixed on 1 January 2022, the day after her third birthday had passed): 80%. On 1 March
-- 2023, 4: no adjustment.
`C-toddler` MEANS `a contract effective` (YMD 2020 1 1) `for an insured born` (YMD 2018 5 1) `of sex` `female`
#ASSERT `14 — under` `C-toddler` `the sum insured` 1000000000 `as adjusted for an event on` (YMD 2022 3 1) EQUALS 800000000
#ASSERT `14 — under` `C-toddler` `the sum insured` 1000000000 `as adjusted for an event on` (YMD 2023 3 1) EQUALS 1000000000

§§ `12.1 The funeral benefit`

-- The lesser of 10% of the sum insured and 30 million: 300 million gives 30; 200 gives 20;
-- 500 gives 30; with the cap moved to 50 million by the Business Procedures, 50.
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 300000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS 30000000
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 200000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS 20000000
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 500000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS 30000000
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 500000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` (JUST 50000000)) EQUALS 50000000
-- After one year from the effective date: not on 1 January 2021 (fork F-12a), on 2 January.
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2021 1 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 300000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2021 1 2) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 300000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS 30000000
-- A cause Article 19 excludes; a contract not in force; a child of 3 Tuổi (240 million).
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `by` (`The cause of a death` OF JUST (YMD 2021 6 1), NOTHING) `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 300000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` FALSE `, sum insured` 300000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `12.1 — the funeral benefit advanced on` (`a death claim under` `C-toddler` `on` (YMD 2022 3 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 300000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 0 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS 24000000

§§ `12.2 and 12.3 The death benefit; 19.1`

-- (a)(i): 200% of 1 billion, plus 50 million dividends and 5 million interest.
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 50000000 `, interest` 5000000 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 2055000000
-- (b): after a decision to pay the late-stage benefit, 100%.
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 50000000 `, interest` 5000000 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` (JUST (YMD 2029 1 1)) `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 1055000000
-- (a)(ii): after the coupon arose on 1 January 2061, 100%; the day before it, 200%.
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2062 1 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 50000000 `, interest` 5000000 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 1055000000
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2060 12 31) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 50000000 `, interest` 5000000 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 2055000000
-- Chapter 2's floor: 200% of 100 million is less than 250 million of premiums.
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` 100000000 `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 250000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 250000000
-- 12.3: 2,055 million less 100 million of Debt and the 30 million funeral advance.
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 50000000 `, interest` 5000000 `, debt` 100000000 `, funeral advanced` 30000000 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 1925000000
-- Not in force.
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` `a natural cause` `, in force` FALSE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `nothing: the contract was not in force at the death`
-- 19.1(a): suicide on 31 December 2021, within two years of 1 January 2020; on 1 January 2022,
-- not (fork F-19a). Excluded: the greater of the surrender value (0) and 300 million.
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2021 12 31) `by` (`The cause of a death` OF JUST (YMD 2021 12 31), NOTHING) `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the payment on a death excluded by Article 19.1` 300000000 (LIST `19.1(a) suicide within two years`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2022 1 1) `by` (`The cause of a death` OF JUST (YMD 2022 1 1), NOTHING) `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 2000000000
-- 19.1(b): a beneficiary's intentional crime excludes; an unintentional one, or someone
-- else's, does not.
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` (`The cause of a death` OF NOTHING, JUST (`A criminal act` OF `a beneficiary of the contract`, FALSE)) `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the payment on a death excluded by Article 19.1` 300000000 (LIST `19.1(b) a criminal act`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` (`The cause of a death` OF NOTHING, JUST (`A criminal act` OF `a beneficiary of the contract`, TRUE)) `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 2000000000
#ASSERT `the answer on the death claim` (`a death claim under` `C1` `on` (YMD 2030 6 1) `by` (`The cause of a death` OF NOTHING, JUST (`A criminal act` OF `someone else`, FALSE)) `, in force` TRUE `, sum insured` `1 billion` `, dividends` 0 `, interest` 0 `, debt` 0 `, funeral advanced` 0 `, premiums` 300000000 `, late stage decided` NOTHING `, funeral cap` NOTHING) EQUALS `the death benefit, settled` 2000000000

§§ `13.1 to 13.4 The amounts`

-- 13.1(a): 25% of 1.6 billion is 400 million; of 2 billion, 500; of 2.4 billion, capped at 500;
-- with 200 million paid under other contracts, 300; with 600 million, nothing.
#ASSERT `13.1(a) — the early-stage benefit on a sum insured of` 1600000000 `, with` 0 `paid under other contracts` EQUALS 400000000
#ASSERT `13.1(a) — the early-stage benefit on a sum insured of` 2000000000 `, with` 0 `paid under other contracts` EQUALS 500000000
#ASSERT `13.1(a) — the early-stage benefit on a sum insured of` 2400000000 `, with` 0 `paid under other contracts` EQUALS 500000000
#ASSERT `13.1(a) — the early-stage benefit on a sum insured of` 2400000000 `, with` 200000000 `paid under other contracts` EQUALS 300000000
#ASSERT `13.1(a) — the early-stage benefit on a sum insured of` 2400000000 `, with` 600000000 `paid under other contracts` EQUALS 0
-- 13.2(a): 50% of 1.6 billion less 400 million paid for the same illness; of 3 billion,
-- capped at 1 billion, less 500; with 900 million paid elsewhere, 100 less 500: not provided for.
#ASSERT `13.2(a) — the middle-stage benefit on a sum insured of` 1600000000 `, with` 0 `paid under other contracts and` 400000000 `paid for the same illness` EQUALS 400000000
#ASSERT `13.2(a) — the middle-stage benefit on a sum insured of` 3000000000 `, with` 0 `paid under other contracts and` 500000000 `paid for the same illness` EQUALS 500000000
#ASSERT REFUSED `13.2(a) — the middle-stage benefit on a sum insured of` 3000000000 `, with` 900000000 `paid under other contracts and` 500000000 `paid for the same illness` BECAUSE "13.2 does not say what follows when the earlier payments for the same illness exceed the middle-stage benefit"
-- 13.3(a): 1 billion less 750 million; less nothing; less 1.2 billion: not provided for.
#ASSERT `13.3(a) — the late-stage benefit on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `, with` 750000000 `paid for the same illness` EQUALS 250000000
#ASSERT `13.3(a) — the late-stage benefit on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `, with` 0 `paid for the same illness` EQUALS `1 billion`
#ASSERT REFUSED `13.3(a) — the late-stage benefit on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `, with` 1200000000 `paid for the same illness` BECAUSE "13.3 does not say what follows when the earlier payments for the same illness exceed the sum insured"
#ASSERT `13.4 — the additional benefit on a sum insured of` `1 billion` EQUALS 250000000

§§ `13.5 The comfort cash coupon`

-- C1: 34 Tuổi at the issue date: at 75 Tuổi, 1 January 2061. Born 1 July 1970: 49 at issue,
-- 49 + 26 = 75, 1 January 2046. Born 1 July 1964: 55 (the boundary), 20 years to 75, 1 January
-- 2040. Born 1 July 1963: 56, over 55, so the 20th anniversary, 1 January 2040, not the 19th
-- (when that insured would reach 75).
#ASSERT `13.5 — the comfort cash coupon date of` `C1` EQUALS YMD 2061 1 1
#ASSERT `13.5 — the comfort cash coupon date of` (`a contract effective` (YMD 2020 1 1) `for an insured born` (YMD 1970 7 1) `of sex` `male`) EQUALS YMD 2046 1 1
#ASSERT `13.5 — the comfort cash coupon date of` (`a contract effective` (YMD 2020 1 1) `for an insured born` (YMD 1964 7 1) `of sex` `male`) EQUALS YMD 2040 1 1
#ASSERT `13.5 — the comfort cash coupon date of` (`a contract effective` (YMD 2020 1 1) `for an insured born` (YMD 1963 7 1) `of sex` `male`) EQUALS YMD 2040 1 1
-- The amount: 1 billion less 250 million received; less 1.5 billion: not provided for
-- (finding X-5); not paid after the late-stage benefit, or after death.
#ASSERT `13.5 — the coupon, in force` TRUE `, alive` TRUE `, late stage received` FALSE `, on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `less` 250000000 EQUALS `the coupon is` 750000000
#ASSERT REFUSED `13.5 — the coupon, in force` TRUE `, alive` TRUE `, late stage received` FALSE `, on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `less` 1500000000 BECAUSE "13.5 does not say what follows when the early- and middle-stage benefits received exceed the sum insured"
#ASSERT `13.5 — the coupon, in force` TRUE `, alive` TRUE `, late stage received` TRUE `, on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `less` 0 EQUALS `no coupon: the contract is not in force, the insured has died, or the late-stage benefit was received`
#ASSERT `13.5 — the coupon, in force` TRUE `, alive` FALSE `, late stage received` FALSE `, on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `less` 0 EQUALS `no coupon: the contract is not in force, the insured has died, or the late-stage benefit was received`

§§ `The annexes, by hand`

-- Late-stage annex (a)-(f): an activity named twice counts once.
#ASSERT `the number of activities of daily living in` (LIST `washing`, `washing`, `feeding`) EQUALS 2
-- Item numbers read against the PDF pages: a sub-heading under a number carries it.
#ASSERT `the listing of` `defibrillator insertion` EQUALS `A listing` OF `Annex 1, the early-stage list`, 12
#ASSERT `the listing of` `coma of at least 72 continuous hours` EQUALS `A listing` OF `Annex 1, the middle-stage list`, 6
#ASSERT `the listing of` `Creutzfeldt-Jakob disease` EQUALS `A listing` OF `Annex 1, the late-stage list`, 48
#ASSERT `the listing of` `Kawasaki disease` EQUALS `A listing` OF `Annex 3, the list for children`, 7
-- Moderate Parkinson's: 2 of the 6 activities for 6 months; one is not enough.
#ASSERT `the definition of the listed condition is met by` (`a diagnosis of` `moderate Parkinson's disease` `on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, measured` (LIST (`A measurement` OF `months the qualifying state has lasted`, 6)) `, unable to do` (LIST `washing`, `dressing`) `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT (`the definition of the listed condition is met by` (`a diagnosis of` `moderate Parkinson's disease` `on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, measured` (LIST (`A measurement` OF `months the qualifying state has lasted`, 6)) `, unable to do` (LIST `washing`) `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING))
-- src:1505-1506: coma from alcohol is excluded; coma in a person with HIV is not excluded by
-- the coma definition (near miss).
#ASSERT NOT (`the definition of the listed condition is met by` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` (LIST `alcohol`) `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING))
#ASSERT `the definition of the listed condition is met by` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` (LIST `HIV infection`) `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING)
-- src:1760: viral encephalitis from HIV is excluded.
#ASSERT NOT (`the definition of the listed condition is met by` (`a diagnosis of` `viral encephalitis with full recovery` `on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, measured` EMPTY `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` (LIST `HIV infection`) `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING))
-- A threshold the diagnosis does not report cannot be decided.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the definition of the listed condition is met by` (`a plain diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `measuring` EMPTY) BECAUSE "the diagnosis does not report a quantity whose threshold the definition states"

§§ `The decision on a critical illness claim, layer by layer`

-- S1, the covered case: an early-stage coma of 50 hours, 1 June 2021, sum insured 1 billion.
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50)) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 250000000

-- 18(a): issued 1 January 2020; 90 days later is 31 March 2020. A first sign on 31 March is
-- within the waiting period; on 1 April 2020, after it (fork F-18a).
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2020 4 15) `, first sign` (YMD 2020 3 31) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `not payable` `18(a): the condition began within the 90-day waiting period`
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2020 4 15) `, first sign` (YMD 2020 4 1) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 250000000
-- 18: the Accident exception: a coma from an Accident in February 2020 is not held back.
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2020 2 5) `, first sign` (YMD 2020 2 1) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` NOTHING `, accident` (JUST (`an accident on` (YMD 2020 2 1) `, injuring on` (YMD 2020 2 1)))) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 250000000

-- 18(b): diagnosed 1 June 2021; a death on 30 June (29 days) fails; on 1 July (30 days) passes
-- (fork F-18b); alive, and decided on 30 June, it cannot yet be decided.
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` (JUST (YMD 2021 6 30)) `, accident` NOTHING) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `not payable` `18(b): the insured did not survive 30 days from the diagnosis`
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` (JUST (YMD 2021 7 1)) `, accident` NOTHING) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 250000000
#ASSERT REFUSED `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a full claim under` `C1` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50)) `on` `1 billion` `, in force` TRUE `, paid` EMPTY `, other contracts` 0 `, coupon approved` NOTHING `, decided` (YMD 2021 6 30)) BECAUSE "the 30-day survival period of Article 18(b) has not yet run when the claim is decided"

-- 19.2: (b) self-inflicted injury; (c) nuclear; (a) the insured's own intentional crime; near
-- miss, an unintentional one; (d) a pre-existing condition (examined 31 December 2019, before
-- issue) not declared; near miss, declared and accepted. (The first sign is left at the
-- diagnosis day so that only Article 19 is tested.)
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50) `, first examined` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, declared` FALSE `, self-harm` TRUE `, crime` NOTHING `, nuclear` FALSE) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `not payable` `19.2: an exclusion applies`
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50) `, first examined` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, declared` FALSE `, self-harm` FALSE `, crime` NOTHING `, nuclear` TRUE) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `not payable` `19.2: an exclusion applies`
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50) `, first examined` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, declared` FALSE `, self-harm` FALSE `, crime` (JUST (`A criminal act` OF `the insured himself or herself`, FALSE)) `, nuclear` FALSE) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `not payable` `19.2: an exclusion applies`
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50) `, first examined` (YMD 2021 6 1) `, declared` FALSE `, self-harm` FALSE `, crime` (JUST (`A criminal act` OF `the insured himself or herself`, TRUE)) `, nuclear` FALSE) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 250000000
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50) `, first examined` (YMD 2019 12 31) `, declared` FALSE `, self-harm` FALSE `, crime` NOTHING `, nuclear` FALSE) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `not payable` `19.2: an exclusion applies`
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50) `, first examined` (YMD 2019 12 31) `, declared` TRUE `, self-harm` FALSE `, crime` NOTHING `, nuclear` FALSE) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 250000000

-- The annex definition: 47 hours of coma is not 48.
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C1` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2021 6 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 47)) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `not payable` `Annexes: the definition of the listed condition is not met`

-- 13.1(b): (i) four earlier early-stage payments use the stage up, three do not; (i) the same
-- condition again; (ii) another condition the same day, or at the same visit; (iii) the same
-- paired organ (both kidneys: removal of one kidney, then chronic kidney damage).
GIVEN cond  IS A `A listed condition`
      dx    IS A DATE
      visit IS A NUMBER
      organ IS A MAYBE `A paired organ`
GIVETH A `A critical illness benefit already paid`
`early paid` cond dx visit organ MEANS `a payment for` cond `of` 250000000 `, diagnosed` dx `at visit` visit `, organ` organ `, same illness` FALSE `, approved` dx
`the kidney readings` MEANS LIST (`A measurement` OF `eGFR in ml per minute per 1.73 square metres of body surface`, 20), (`A measurement` OF `days the qualifying state has lasted`, 100)
