-- The annex bars: mild coronary artery disease is barred once endoscopic coronary surgery is
-- claimed, and the surgery once mild disease is claimed (finding X-3); moderate disease and
-- the surgery bar each other too. Near miss: each claimed alone is paid.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `A measurement`
`cad readings` n MEANS LIST (`A measurement` OF `number of named coronary arteries narrowed by at least 60%`, n)
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a claim under` `C1` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `mild coronary artery disease` `on` (YMD 2025 6 1) `measuring` (`cad readings` 2)) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `, after the payments` EMPTY `, the claims made being` (LIST `mild coronary artery disease`)) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 250000000
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a claim under` `C1` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `mild coronary artery disease` `on` (YMD 2025 6 1) `measuring` (`cad readings` 2)) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `, after the payments` EMPTY `, the claims made being` (LIST `mild coronary artery disease`, `endoscopic coronary surgery`)) EQUALS `not payable` `Annex 1: barred by a claim for another condition`
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a claim under` `C1` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `endoscopic coronary surgery` `on` (YMD 2025 6 1) `measuring` EMPTY) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `, after the payments` EMPTY `, the claims made being` (LIST `endoscopic coronary surgery`)) EQUALS `payable` `the middle-stage benefit (13.2)` 500000000
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a claim under` `C1` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `moderate coronary artery disease` `on` (YMD 2025 6 1) `measuring` (`cad readings` 3)) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion` `, after the payments` EMPTY `, the claims made being` (LIST `endoscopic coronary surgery`, `moderate coronary artery disease`)) EQUALS `not payable` `Annex 1: barred by a claim for another condition`
-- src:1849-1851: tracheostomy is not paid after major cancer has been paid; here the cancer
