-- THE LAYERS TOGETHER. The toddler of C-toddler (3 Tuổi on 1 March 2022), an early-stage coma
-- first showing on 1 February 2022 (past the waiting period), alive: cover, then Article 14
-- (80%), then the 25%, then the 500 million cap. Sum insured 3 billion: 2.4 billion, 25% is
-- 600 million, capped at 500. Sum insured 2 billion: 1.6 billion, 400 million. A late-stage
-- coma for her, sum insured 1 billion: 800 million. At 4 Tuổi (1 March 2023), 1.6 billion: 400.
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C-toddler` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2022 3 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2022 2 1) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING) `on a sum insured of` 3000000000) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 500000000
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C-toddler` `for` (`a diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2022 3 1) `, first sign` (YMD 2022 2 1) `, measured` (`coma readings of` 50) `, unable to do` EMPTY `, alternative` FALSE `, causes` EMPTY `, death` NOTHING `, accident` NOTHING) `on a sum insured of` 2000000000) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 400000000
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C-toddler` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `coma of at least 96 hours` `on` (YMD 2022 3 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 100)) `on a sum insured of` `1 billion`) EQUALS `payable` `the late-stage benefit (13.3)` 800000000
#ASSERT `the answer on the critical illness claim` (`a first claim under` `C-toddler` `for` (`a plain diagnosis of` `coma of at least 48 hours` `on` (YMD 2023 3 1) `measuring` (`coma readings of` 50)) `on a sum insured of` 1600000000) EQUALS `payable` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` 400000000

§§ `Articles 15 to 17`

-- 15(a).
#ASSERT `15(a) — a periodic dividend may be declared at the anniversary: premiums paid up` TRUE `, first premium of year 2 paid` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`15(a) — a periodic dividend may be declared at the anniversary: premiums paid up` FALSE `, first premium of year 2 paid` TRUE)
-- 15(b), C1 (premium term to the 15th anniversary, 34 Tuổi at issue, less than 65 - 15 = 50):
-- at the 15th anniversary, not the 14th; and at each anniversary to the one at which she
-- reaches 65 Tuổi (34 + 31: the 31st), not the 32nd. Not if any premium was missed.
#ASSERT `15(b) — under` `C1` `a loyalty dividend falls due at anniversary` 15 `, premiums paid in full` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`15(b) — under` `C1` `a loyalty dividend falls due at anniversary` 14 `, premiums paid in full` TRUE)
#ASSERT `15(b) — under` `C1` `a loyalty dividend falls due at anniversary` 16 `, premiums paid in full` TRUE
#ASSERT `15(b) — under` `C1` `a loyalty dividend falls due at anniversary` 31 `, premiums paid in full` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`15(b) — under` `C1` `a loyalty dividend falls due at anniversary` 32 `, premiums paid in full` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`15(b) — under` `C1` `a loyalty dividend falls due at anniversary` 15 `, premiums paid in full` FALSE)
-- Born 1 July 1969: 50 Tuổi at issue, not less than 50: the 15th only.
`C-50` MEANS `a contract effective` (YMD 2020 1 1) `for an insured born` (YMD 1969 7 1) `of sex` `male`
#ASSERT `15(b) — under` `C-50` `a loyalty dividend falls due at anniversary` 15 `, premiums paid in full` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`15(b) — under` `C-50` `a loyalty dividend falls due at anniversary` 16 `, premiums paid in full` TRUE)

-- 16.
#ASSERT `16.1 — the coupon remaining after the debt, of` 100000000 `less` 30000000 EQUALS 70000000
#ASSERT `16.1 — the coupon remaining after the debt, of` 100000000 `less` 150000000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `16 — the method for a payment, a dividend` FALSE `, chosen` NOTHING `, earlier dividend choice` NOTHING EQUALS `left with the Company at interest`
#ASSERT `16 — the method for a payment, a dividend` TRUE `, chosen` NOTHING `, earlier dividend choice` (JUST `applied to premiums as they fall due`) EQUALS `applied to premiums as they fall due`
#ASSERT `16 — the method for a payment, a dividend` TRUE `, chosen` (JUST `paid in cash at once`) `, earlier dividend choice` (JUST `applied to premiums as they fall due`) EQUALS `paid in cash at once`

